 public function seed(array $seed):void{$this->transaction(function()use($seed){if($this->setting('seeded',false))return;Validation::check(!$this->all(),'Dolu katalog başlangıç verisiyle değiştirilemez.');$records=array_map([Validation::class,'managed'],$seed['records']);$this->identities($records);foreach($records as $r)$this->write($r);$this->setSetting('site-settings',Validation::siteSettings($seed['siteSettings']));$this->setSetting('admission-rules',Admission::validate($seed['admissionRules']));$translations=new Translations($this->db,$this);foreach($seed['translations']??[] as $t){$source=null;foreach($records as $r)if($r['kind']===$t['kind']&&$r['id']===$t['id'])$source=$r;Validation::check($source,'Başlangıç çevirisi kaynağı eksik.');$translations->save(array_replace($t,['revision'=>0,'sourceRevision'=>$source['revision'],'status'=>'published','publishAt'=>null,'seoApproved'=>false,'seo'=>[],'reviewNote'=>'Bundled English seed translation; editor SEO review required.']));}(new CatalogQuery($this->db,$this))->rebuild();$this->setSetting('seeded',true);});}
 public function getAdminSnapshot(array $input=[]):array{
 $where=[];$args=[];$kind=$input['kind']??'';$q=$input['q']??'';Validation::check(is_string($kind)&&is_string($q),'Invalid catalog query.');if($kind!==''){Validation::check(in_array($kind,['app','article','list'],true),'Invalid record kind.');$where[]='kind=?';$args[]=$kind;}if($q!==''){$where[]="LOWER(payload) LIKE LOWER(?) ESCAPE '!'";$args[]='%'.str_replace(['!','%','_'],['!!','!%','!_'],mb_substr($q,0,200)).'%';}$condition=$where?' WHERE '.implode(' AND ',$where):'';$total=(int)$this->query('SELECT COUNT(*) FROM ws_records'.$condition,$args)->fetchColumn();$pages=max(1,(int)ceil($total/100));$page=max(1,min($pages,is_scalar($input['page']??1)?(int)($input['page']??1):1));$rows=$this->query('SELECT payload FROM ws_records'.$condition.' ORDER BY kind,id LIMIT 100 OFFSET '.(($page-1)*100),$args)->fetchAll();
 $counts=['total'=>0,'app'=>0,'article'=>0,'list'=>0,'draft'=>0,'review'=>0,'scheduled'=>0,'published'=>0,'archived'=>0,'seoApproved'=>0];foreach($this->query("SELECT kind,JSON_UNQUOTE(JSON_EXTRACT(payload,'$.status')) AS status,JSON_UNQUOTE(JSON_EXTRACT(payload,'$.seoApproved')) AS approved,COUNT(*) AS total FROM ws_records GROUP BY kind,status,approved")->fetchAll()as$row){$count=(int)$row['total'];$counts['total']+=$count;$counts[$row['kind']]+=$count;$counts[$row['status']]+=$count;if($row['approved']==='true')$counts['seoApproved']+=$count;}
 return ['records'=>array_map(fn($r)=>json_decode($r['payload'],true,512,JSON_THROW_ON_ERROR),$rows),'pagination'=>['total'=>$total,'page'=>$page,'pages'=>$pages,'pageSize'=>100],'counts'=>$counts,'feedback'=>$this->query('SELECT * FROM ws_feedback ORDER BY id DESC LIMIT 500')->fetchAll(),'audit'=>$this->query('SELECT * FROM ws_audit ORDER BY id DESC LIMIT 500')->fetchAll()];}
 public function selectedRecords(array $selection):array{$out=[];foreach(array_chunk($selection,100) as $batch){$where=[];$args=[];foreach($batch as $r){$where[]='(kind=? AND id=?)';array_push($args,$r['kind'],$r['id']);}if($where)foreach($this->query('SELECT payload FROM ws_records WHERE '.implode(' OR ',$where),$args)->fetchAll() as $row)$out[]=json_decode($row['payload'],true,512,JSON_THROW_ON_ERROR);}return $out;}
 /** Bounded data for module previews; never scans unrelated private records. */
 public function extensionCatalog(array $requirements,string $locale,bool $includeHomepage=false):array {
  if($includeHomepage)return (new CatalogQuery($this->db,$this))->forPage(Localization::path($locale),[]);
  $query=new CatalogQuery($this->db,$this);$selection=[];$ids=array_slice(array_values(array_unique($requirements['appIds']??[])),0,96);
  if($ids)$selection=$query->search(['ids'=>implode(',',$ids),'limit'=>100],$locale)['items'];
  $limit=max(0,min(6,(int)($requirements['latestArticleLimit']??0)));
  if($limit)array_push($selection,...$query->latestArticles($locale,$limit));
  return $this->getPublicSnapshot($selection);
 }
 public function getPublicSnapshot(?array $selection=null):array{$rules=$this->getAdmissionRules();$seo=(new SEOSettings($this,$this->config))->get();$out=['appSubmissions'=>['enabled'=>(new AppSubmissions($this->db,$this,$this->config))->settings()['enabled']],'admissionRules'=>$rules,'admissions'=>[],'siteSettings'=>$this->getSiteSettings(),'siteName'=>$seo['siteName'],'branding'=>$seo['branding']??Branding::defaults(),'apps'=>[],'articles'=>[],'lists'=>[],'records'=>[]];$selected=$selection===null?$this->all():$this->selectedRecords($selection);foreach($selected as $r){if($r['status']!=='published'&&!($r['status']==='scheduled'&&!empty($r['publishAt'])&&strtotime($r['publishAt'])<=time()))continue;if($r['kind']==='app'){$a=Admission::evaluate($r['data'],$rules,$r['admissionException']??'');if(!$a['accepted'])continue;$out['admissions'][$r['id']]=$a;}$out[['app'=>'apps','article'=>'articles','list'=>'lists'][$r['kind']]][]=$r['data'];$out['records'][]=array_intersect_key($r,array_flip(['id','kind','updatedAt','seoApproved','revision','sourceLocale']));$out['records'][array_key_last($out['records'])]['sourceFingerprint']=Translations::fingerprint($r['data']);}$translations=new Translations($this->db,$this);$out['localization']=$translations->settings();$out['translations']=$translations->publicRows($out['records']);$extensions=new Extensions($this);$out['extensionCardsByLocale']=[];foreach($out['localization']['locales'] as $locale)if($locale['enabled'])$out['extensionCardsByLocale'][$locale['code']]=$extensions->cards($locale['code']);$out['extensionCards']=$out['extensionCardsByLocale']['tr']??[];$out['extensionBlocksByLocale']=[];foreach($out['localization']['locales'] as $locale)if($locale['enabled'])$out['extensionBlocksByLocale'][$locale['code']]=$extensions->blocks($out,$locale['code']);$out['extensionBlocks']=$out['extensionBlocksByLocale']['tr']??[];$out['capabilities']=(new Capabilities($this->db,$this))->publicData($out['apps']);$out['performanceSettings']=(new Performance($this->db,$this))->settings();$out['storeObservations']=(new StoreObservations($this->db,$this))->publicData($out['apps']);return $out;}
 public function history(string $kind,string $id):array{return array_map(fn($r)=>json_decode($r['payload'],true,512,JSON_THROW_ON_ERROR),$this->query('SELECT payload FROM ws_revisions WHERE kind=? AND id=? ORDER BY revision DESC',[$kind,$id])->fetchAll());}
 public function saveRecord(array $input):array{
 if(!isset($input['sourceLocale'])&&($input['revision']??0)===0)$input['sourceLocale']=(new Translations($this->db,$this))->settings()['sourceLocale'];$r=Validation::managed($input);
 return $this->transaction(function()use($r){
  $locale=$r['sourceLocale']??'tr';$settings=(new Translations($this->db,$this))->settings();Validation::check(in_array($locale,array_column(array_filter($settings['locales'],fn($row)=>$row['enabled']),'code'),true)&&Localization::complete($locale),'The source language must be installed and enabled.');
  if($r['kind']==='app'&&$r['status']!=='archived')foreach($r['data']['storeIds']??[] as $identity){$owner=$this->query("SELECT id FROM ws_records WHERE kind='app' AND id<>? AND JSON_UNQUOTE(JSON_EXTRACT(payload,'$.status'))<>'archived' AND JSON_CONTAINS(JSON_EXTRACT(payload,'$.data.storeIds'),?) LIMIT 1",[$r['id'],$this->json(array_intersect_key($identity,array_flip(['platform','country','storeId'])))])->fetchColumn();Validation::check($owner===false,'Store identity belongs to another app.');}
  if($r['kind']==='app'&&in_array($r['status'],['published','scheduled'],true))Validation::check(Admission::evaluate($r['data'],$this->getAdmissionRules(),$r['admissionException']??'')['accepted'],'The record does not meet admission rules. Add sourced observations or an editorial exception.');
  $collision=$this->query('SELECT base_id FROM ws_translations WHERE kind=? AND locale=? AND slug=? AND base_id<>?',[$r['kind'],$locale,$r['id'],$r['id']])->fetchColumn();if($collision!==false)throw new ApiException('This source address belongs to an existing translation.',409);
  $old=$this->record($r['kind'],$r['id']);if(($old&&($r['revision']??null)!==$old['revision'])||(!$old&&($r['revision']??0)!==0))throw new ApiException('Record changed. Load the latest version.',409);if($old&&($old['sourceLocale']??'tr')!==$locale)throw new ApiException('The source language of an existing record cannot be changed.',409);
  $next=array_replace($r,['revision'=>($old['revision']??0)+1,'updatedAt'=>self::now()]);
  if($old&&$this->json($old['data'])!==$this->json($next['data'])){$next['seoApproved']=false;if($next['kind']==='app'){$links=$this->query("SELECT payload FROM ws_records WHERE (kind='article' AND JSON_CONTAINS(JSON_EXTRACT(payload,'$.data.appIds'),?)) OR (kind='list' AND JSON_CONTAINS(JSON_EXTRACT(payload,'$.data.entries[*].appId'),?))",[$this->json($next['id']),$this->json($next['id'])]);while($row=$links->fetch()){$linked=json_decode($row['payload'],true,512,JSON_THROW_ON_ERROR);$this->write(array_replace($linked,['revision'=>$linked['revision']+1,'updatedAt'=>$next['updatedAt'],'seoApproved'=>false,'reviewNote'=>'A linked app changed; review the sources and SEO approval.']));}}}
  $this->write($next);$this->audit('save',$r['kind'].':'.$r['id'],$next['status'].'; revision='.$next['revision']);return $next;
 });}
